*> NEXUS-COBOL — branches IF + EVALUATE + AND (banc N15)
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. BRANCHES.
AUTHOR. DGK.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 NOTE PIC 9(3) VALUE 85.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    IF NOTE >= 90 THEN DISPLAY "GRADE=A" ELSE DISPLAY "GRADE=B" END-IF
    EVALUATE NOTE
        WHEN 85 DISPLAY "QUATRE-VINGT-CINQ"
        WHEN 70 DISPLAY "SOIXANTE-DIX"
        WHEN OTHER DISPLAY "AUTRE"
    END-EVALUATE
    IF NOTE < 90 AND NOTE > 50 THEN DISPLAY "MOYENNE-PLUS" END-IF
    STOP RUN.
